  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\n{夜|よ} (night) + {更|ふ}かし (staying late) - from {更|ふ}かす (to stay up late)\n\nRELATED SLEEP VOCABULARY:\n- ⟦{寝不足|ねぶそく}→寝不足：07692_nebusoku⟧ - lack of sleep\n- ⟦{二度寝|にどね}→二度寝：07694_nidone⟧ - going back to sleep\n- ⟦{徹夜|てつや}→徹夜：03552_tetsuya⟧ - pulling an all-nighter\n- ⟦{早寝早起|はやねはやお}き→早寝早起き：17150_hayanehayaoki⟧ - early to bed, early to rise\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {夜更|よふ}かし⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ - to stay up late\n- {夜更|よふ}かし⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{続|つづ}く→続く：00903_tsuzuku⟧ - staying up late continues\n- ⟦ついつい→ついつい：10371_tsuitsui⟧{夜更|よふ}かし⟦して→する：00392_suru⟧しまう - to unintentionally stay up late",
